WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:04.231
<v Ana Ribeiro>Hi Livia, nice to meet you. Thanks for accepting the invite.</v>

2
00:00:06.000 --> 00:00:11.385
<v Livia Prado>Hi Ana. A colleague recommended you, so I wanted to understand what you do.</v>

3
00:00:17.000 --> 00:00:21.615
<v Ana Ribeiro>Happy to explain. But first, tell me a bit about Delta Pharma.</v>

4
00:00:23.000 --> 00:00:31.077
<v Livia Prado>We're a mid-sized pharmaceutical company. We have about one hundred and fifty medical representatives who visit doctors and pharmacies every day.</v>

5
00:01:08.000 --> 00:01:15.308
<v Livia Prado>Their visit reports are in a very old system that nobody likes. I'm looking at options for next year.</v>

6
00:03:33.000 --> 00:03:37.231
<v Ana Ribeiro>What would a better tool need to do for the representatives?</v>

7
00:03:40.000 --> 00:03:46.923
<v Livia Prado>Plan the visits, record what was discussed, and track samples. And it has to work on a tablet.</v>

8
00:09:13.000 --> 00:09:19.154
<v Ana Ribeiro>We have pharma clients doing exactly that. I'll send you a short overview after the call.</v>

9
00:09:24.000 --> 00:09:26.692
<v Livia Prado>Great. I'll share it with my director.</v>

10
00:25:33.000 --> 00:25:35.308
<v Livia Prado>Thanks, Ana. Nice to meet you.</v>
